@startuml pathmap-migration-flow
' ============================================================================
' pathmap-migration-flow.puml — backend migration path PathMap → DynamicDawg → DAT.
' Replaces the ASCII "decision guide" flow in
' docs/algorithms/implementations/pathmap-dictionary.md.
' Color key:  amber = start / prototype backend   green = specialized backends
'             amber diamonds = decisions
' ============================================================================
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFE0B2
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #F9A825
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #37474F
skinparam TitleFontSize 15

title Backend migration path — start simple, specialize as needs sharpen

start
:**PathMapDictionary**\nsimplest · great for prototyping;<<#FFF59D>>
if (Performance matters?) then (yes)
  :**DynamicDawg**\n(~3× faster);<<#C8E6C9>>
  if (Static / read-only dictionary?) then (yes)
    :**DoubleArrayTrie**\n(~12× faster, most compact);<<#C8E6C9>>
  else (keeps mutating)
  endif
else (no — keep it simple)
endif
stop
@enduml
